+emitted `.sing` file.  The map from variables to `Gbar` monomials is in
+`g9966_delta52_joint_results.json` under `unknown_terms`.
+
+Floor/attainment and carrier/attainment: nonunit high-band systems mean only
+that this bounded necessary slice has points.  They do not construct a full
+Keller pair and do not prove `SURVIVES`.
