+| `Q` | 2 | 8 | 4 | `NONUNIT` | 7 | 0.009s |
+
+The basis is `split_c-1`, `g_27_71`, `g_27_70`, `gamma*T-1`.
+
+Depth 5 (`Gbar` bands `27,26,25,24,23`):
+
+| field | equations | `Gbar` unknowns | basis size | verdict | dim | time |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---|---:|---:|
+| `GF(32003)` | 2 | 12 | 4 | `NONUNIT` | 11 | 0.012s |
