+## Controls
+
+Moh `(64,48)` / Appendix-II control: `PASS`.
+
+I ran the p.208 reduced common-polynomial `(16,12)` ansatz in this lane.  The
+minor side is trivial there (`u_s=1`), so no split variables are added.  The
+Singular system over `Q` has 77 coefficient equations and 19 unknowns excluding
+`T` (18 coefficient parameters plus `gamma`).  With Rabinowitsch localizer
